  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 1e36ebc0b8de90543a18645594dd9db3, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  note: "These hits are almost the same as the DrumKit hits, but instead of moving
    hold positions for one hand pick up objects, they move the player object itself.
    \n\nSince the player sits while using the DrumKit\u2019s multiple type interaction,
    it is pinned down on stool. By rotating or moving the player object, we can create
    body movements that complement the drum hits. \n\nTry disabling and enabling this
    Hit Controller when hitting the drums to see the difference."
