  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  note: 'AutoPickDrop component:


    Automatically picks up or drops object when player enters trigger area. If object
    is not picked, it picks up. If object is picked, it drops. Resets interaction
    state when player leaves area, allowing pick/drop cycle to repeat on re-entry.'
