  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 1e36ebc0b8de90543a18645594dd9db3, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  note: 'AutoDrop component:


    Automatically drops a picked-up object when the character reaches the object''s
    designated drop location. For normal drops, it checks orbital reach and drops
    once. For force drops, it checks orbital reach but destroys/recreates the object
    at the drop location and can trigger repeatedly.'
